# mouse_trap / unavoidably unsafe clone

## Path
`/Users/bbp/mouse_trap`

## Purpose
Clone of https://unavoidablyunsafe.com/ — landing page for "unavoidably unsafe" game/product with email signup.

## Stack
- Next.js 15 (App Router)
- TypeScript
- CSS Modules
- Deploy target: Vercel

## Conventions
- Match original site copy, layout, and styling (Poppins, red accent highlights, hero background image)
- Keep components in `components/`, page in `app/`
- Static assets in `public/`

## Active work
- Deployed on Vercel, linked to GitHub `krismajean/mousetrap`

## Notes
- Production URL: https://unavoidably-unsafe.vercel.app / https://www.mousetrapjenga.com
- Vercel project: `unavoidably-unsafe` (team `krismajeans-projects`)
- Email signup → `POST /api/subscribe` → Resend (contact + notify mousetrapjenga@gmail.com & brian@broompeltz.com + visitor confirmation)
- Env: `RESEND_API_KEY`, `RESEND_FROM`, `NOTIFY_EMAIL`, optional `RESEND_SEGMENT_ID` / `RESEND_REPLY_TO` (see `.env.example`)
- Original is Squarespace; accent color ~ hsl(354, 99%, 47%)
- Rules section distilled from archived Google Sites content in `archive/mousetrapjenga-old/`
- Logo = original circular mark (`public/logo-mark.png`, cropped from logo.png) + “mousetrapjenga” text wordmark
